  "goodToKnow": "Die Dialyse is dialysis, blood purification for people whose kidneys (Nieren) have failed: zur Dialyse gehen, an der Dialyse hängen. Germany has many tens of thousands of dialysis patients, and many wait years for a donor kidney, partly because organ donation requires explicit consent. From Greek dialysis (separation). Plural: die Dialysen."
